OL,3,GNEWSA'Cold' museum reopens after #400k
OL,4,Aheating refit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's only dedicated peace museum
OL,7,Fwill now be able to open all year round
OL,8,Ffollowing a #400,000 investment in its
OL,9,Fheating and air conditioning systems.
OL,11,FThe Peace Museum, in Saltaire, will
OL,12,Freopen later for the first time since
OL,13,Fwork began in August.
OL,15,FFunded by the Department for Culture,
OL,16,FMedia and Sport, curator Aine McKenny
OL,17,Fsaid staying open all year would allow
OL,18,Fup to 15,000 more people to visit
OL,19,Fannually.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
